- [Failover records values](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/resource-record-sets-values-failover.md): When you create failover records, you specify the following values.
- [Failover alias records values](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/resource-record-sets-values-failover-alias.md): When you create failover alias records, you specify the following values.
- [Geolocation records values](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/resource-record-sets-values-geo.md): When you create geolocation records, you specify the following values.
- [Geolocation alias records values](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/resource-record-sets-values-geo-alias.md): When you create geolocation alias records, you specify the following values.
- [Geoproximity records values](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/resource-record-sets-values-geoprox.md): When you create geoproximity records, you specify the following values.
