### [Creating, updating, and deleting health checks](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/health-checks-creating-deleting.md)

Create, update, and delete Route 53 health checks.

- [Creating and updating health checks](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/health-checks-creating.md): The following procedure describes how to create and update health checks using the Route 53 console.
