- [Disabling or enabling health checks](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/health-checks-disable.md): Disabling a health check stops Route 53 from performing health checks.
- [Inverting health checks](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/health-checks-invert.md): If you invert a health check, Route 53 considers the health check to be unhealthy when the status is healthy and vice versa.
